<title>JAPAN: Matsushita - 1qtr group results. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Matsushita - 1qtr group results. [CORRECTED 08:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30, 1996  (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>  Sales		  1.72 trln	 vs	    1.53 trln</p>
<p> (Corrects figure to 1.72 trln from 1.73 trln)</p>
<p>  Operating	   44.4		 vs	   29.5</p>
<p>  Current	prft 50.7		 vs   loss 127.7</p>
<p>  Net	    prft 18.5		 vs   loss 151.3</p>
<p>  EPS	    prft 8.29 yen	   vs    loss 72.16 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd is a large consumer electronics manufacturer.</p>
</text>
